# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Logistics Platform — Docker Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file to .env  (cp .env.docker .env  or  copy .env.docker .env)
#   2. Fill in the three Entra ID values from your Azure Portal registrations
#   3. Never commit .env to Git — it is listed in .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── SQL Server ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Must be at least 8 chars, include upper + lower + digit + symbol
SQL_SA_PASSWORD=LogisticsDemo@2026!

# ── Azure Entra ID ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Found in Azure Portal > Microsoft Entra ID > App registrations

# Directory (tenant) ID — same for all registrations
ENTRA_TENANT_ID=<paste-your-tenant-id-here>

# Application (client) ID of the logistics-platform-api registration
ENTRA_API_CLIENT_ID=<paste-your-api-client-id-here>

# Application (client) ID of the logistics-platform-web registration
ENTRA_WEB_CLIENT_ID=<paste-your-web-client-id-here>
